g"}], "slug": "what-the-dog-remembers", "storyline": "You arrive by car at a rented trailer on the edge of a forest. You moved here to isolate yourself. To heal. To wait until your mind settles and you can trust your senses again.\n\nThe anomalies grow worse each night, creeping closer to the edge of what you can rationalize. Through it all, the dog is always there. Always watching from somewhere. It does not judge, does not speak. It is just a dog, and somehow it is the most solid thing keeping you grounded. The truth of what is happening will only reveal itself to those who pay attention.", "summary": "A retro style psychological horror game. Survive a week in a claustrophobic trailer, spot reality breaking anomalies, and document your findings. Every night tests your perception. Every mistake costs you. Your dog knows.", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/what-the-dog-remembers"}